{"articleNo":"2737","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2737&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-1학기 대학원 석사과정생 수업연한단축신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.26","hit":"10942","attachments":[{"name":"수업연한단축신청서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2737&attachNo=1436"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"374\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"59\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011-1학기 일반대학원 석사 과정생</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;수업연한 단축 신청 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">2011-1학기 일반대학원 석사 과정생 수업연한 단축 신청에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 공지하오니 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 수업연한 단축 신청이란?</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;본교 학부 재학 중 대학원 과목을 사전 이수한 학부생이 대학원에 입학한 경우 대학원 석사과정 수료(또는 졸업)를 위한 수업연한을 6개월(1학기) 단축 할 수 있습니다.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 신청 대상자 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학부 재학 중 대학원 과목을 6학점 사전이수한 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 대학원 입학 후 사전 이수한 과목 6학점에 대하여 학점인정 받은 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 2011학년도 1학기 기준 3학차로 승급하는 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;( ☞ 위 3가지 요건 충족한 자만 신청 가능 )</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 제출기간 : <u><font color=\"#0000ff\">2011. 2. 7(월) ~ 2. 9(수)[3일간]</font></u></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 제출장소 : 각 학과 종합학사행정실</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 제출서류 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수업연한단축신청서 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학부 및 대학원 성적증명서 각 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 유의사항 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학부 재학 중 사전 이수한 학점이 3학점인 학생은 수업연한 단축 불가</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 43.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -43.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">나. 수업연한 단축신청을 했다고 해서 무조건 3학기를 마치고 졸업(수료)하는 것이</span> </font>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 아니라 졸업(수료)에 필요한 요건이 모두 갖추어져야 졸업(수료)이 가능함&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 43.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -43.3pt\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><font size=\"2\"></font></p>\n<p><font size=\"2\"></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"2\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">2011. 01.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원장&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>&nbsp; </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
